(6, 'eb495e92-0488-4092-8b83-580ecb7c24a8', 'apa ada paket?', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 16:21:28\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:30:28\",\"is_signature\":0},{\"id\":8,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"harmony-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Harmoni Desa\",\"location_en\":\"Harmony Village Homestay\",\"price\":215000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, dan menikmati kegiatan edukatif yang menggabungkan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk kunjungan sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Interaksi otentik dengan keluarga lokal<\\/p><p>• Aktivitas pendidikan langsung<\\/p><p>• Jadwal fleksibel untuk kelompok<\\/p><p>• Fasilitator lokal berpengalaman<\\/p><p>• Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• 2 Kali Makan<\\/p><p>• Menginap di rumah penduduk lokal<\\/p><p>• Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan<\\/p><p>• Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>• Pemandu Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>• Bus Antar-Jemput Gratis Bantuan<\\/p><p>• Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>• Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Batik<\\/p><p>• Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>• Musik Jawa Tradisional (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>• Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>• Pembuatan Suvenir<\\/p><p>• Trekking Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Tingkatkan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>• 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🎤 Musik Live \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🔊 Sistem Suara Besar — ​​Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.<\\/p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan edukatif.<\\/p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.<\\/p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11 18:10:59\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:27:23\",\"is_signature\":0}],\"relevance_score\":50}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Paket Wisata ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 5\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: educational-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Edukasi\nlocation_en: Educational Village Homestay\nprice: 250000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, sert...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-08 16:21:28\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:30:28\nis_signature: 0\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 8\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: harmony-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Harmoni Desa\nlocation_en: Harmony Village Homestay\nprice: 215000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-11 18:10:59\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:27:23\nis_signature: 0\n\n', 'Halo Kak! 🙏 Selamat datang di <strong>Desa Wisata Gabugan</strong>.<br>Berikut paket wisata yang bisa Kakak pilih, monggo dilihat-lihat dulu ya 😊<br><br><a href=\"/travel-packages/educational-village-homestay\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 p-2\"><img src=\"http://www.desawisatagabugan.com/storage/travel_package/gallery/wVuZ6zwrXB0bbpNeM7dvdKwDXatMNmxydNjZWhh1.jpg\" onerror=\"this.src=\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595855759920-86582396756a?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\'\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0\" alt=\"1 Hari 1 Malam\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#053d2c] leading-tight\">1 Hari 1 Malam</h4><p class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 line-clamp-2\">DeskripsiTemukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang...</p><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#00a877] mt-1 block\">Rp 250.000 /orang</span></div></div></a><a href=\"/travel-packages/harmony-village-homestay\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 p-2\"><img src=\"http://www.desawisatagabugan.com/storage/travel_package/gallery/sREueHr7CO3XhpbyVUtYHFY5tqdxmKwSSkgeFg6Y.jpg\" onerror=\"this.src=\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595855759920-86582396756a?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\'\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0\" alt=\"1 Hari 1 Malam\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#053d2c] leading-tight\">1 Hari 1 Malam</h4><p class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 line-clamp-2\">DeskripsiTemukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang...</p><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#00a877] mt-1 block\">Rp 215.000 /orang</span></div></div></a><br>Masing-masing paket sudah termasuk pemandu lokal dan konsumsi. Untuk rombongan ada harga khusus lho! 💰<br><br>💡 Mulai dari <strong>1 Hari 1 Malam</strong> untuk pengalaman pertama yang tak terlupakan!<br><br>Monggo, jika ada yang ingin ditanyakan lagi, Kakak bisa langsung hubungi kami via WhatsApp di <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=6281328856252\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-[#00a877] font-semibold hover:underline\">+62 813-2885-6252</a> ya 🙏', 6, 'id', 0, 'API key not configured', '2026-07-19 07:09:39', '2026-07-19 07:09:39'),
(7, 'eb495e92-0488-4092-8b83-580ecb7c24a8', 'untuk 30 orang bisa?', '{\"activities\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"title_id\",\"title_en\",\"slug\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"image\",\"duration_id\",\"duration_en\",\"min_pax\",\"includes_id\",\"includes_en\",\"order\",\"is_featured\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":1,\"title_id\":\"Membajak Sawah Tradisional\",\"title_en\":\"Traditional Rice Field Plowing\",\"slug\":\"membajak-sawah-tradisional\",\"description_id\":\"Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan kerbau yang jinak dan ramah. Dipandu oleh petani lokal berpengalaman, Anda akan belajar teknik membajak tradisional sambil menikmati pemandangan sawah hijau yang asri.\",\"description_en\":\"Experience the sensation of being a traditional farmer by plowing rice fields using a tame and friendly buffalo. Guided by experienced local farmers.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/Cl3BIPPFLJroIAy14VozwjF7MlDI5kqtMZG7Six2.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu, alat membajak, air mineral\",\"includes_en\":\"Guide, plowing tools, mineral water\",\"order\":1,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:41\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:29:17\"},{\"id\":2,\"title_id\":\"Menanam Padi\",\"title_en\":\"Rice Planting\",\"slug\":\"menanam-padi\",\"description_id\":\"Belajar cara menanam padi yang benar dari petani lokal. Mulai dari persiapan lahan, pemilihan bibit, hingga teknik menanam yang baik. Cocok untuk study tour sekolah dan keluarga.\",\"description_en\":\"Learn how to plant rice properly from local farmers. Starting from land preparation, seed selection, to proper planting techniques.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/RhNJzErEcNZNWBDZmTGr908yhPZo3FDpwv014fbE.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu, bibit padi, air mineral\",\"includes_en\":\"Guide, rice seeds, mineral water\",\"order\":2,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:29:54\"},{\"id\":3,\"title_id\":\"Belajar Gamelan & Karawitan\",\"title_en\":\"Learning Gamelan & Karawitan\",\"slug\":\"belajar-gamelan-karawitan\",\"description_id\":\"Mainkan alat musik tradisional Jawa seperti saron, bonang, gong, dan kendang. Dipandu oleh seniman lokal, Anda akan belajar memainkan lagu-lagu tradisional.\",\"description_en\":\"Play traditional Javanese musical instruments such as saron, bonang, gong, and kendang. Guided by local artists.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/xD66noKi23ctgXd0FiuZviKRZzElUvFpUmyh8GOZ.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Instrumen gamelan, pemandu seni, sertifikat\",\"includes_en\":\"Gamelan instruments, art guide, certificate\",\"order\":3,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:31:47\"},{\"id\":4,\"title_id\":\"Belajar Membatik Tulis\",\"title_en\":\"Learn Batik Making\",\"slug\":\"belajar-membatik-tulis\",\"description_id\":\"Belajar membatik tulis menggunakan canting langsung dari pengrajin berpengalaman. Hasil karya sendiri bisa dibawa pulang sebagai buah tangan berharga.\",\"description_en\":\"Learn traditional batik making using canting directly from experienced artisans. Take home your own masterpiece.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/MNMBAWAjxXojOTr0dOJxOgcKkQOoRpQ3KRCSLVlq.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"2-3 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"2-3 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Kain, canting, malam, pewarna, pemandu\",\"includes_en\":\"Fabric, canting, wax, dye, guide\",\"order\":4,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:07\"},{\"id\":5,\"title_id\":\"Petik Salak Pondoh\",\"title_en\":\"Salak Pondoh Harvesting\",\"slug\":\"petik-salak-pondoh\",\"description_id\":\"Petik salak pondoh langsung dari pohon di kebun organik. Ditemani petani lokal, belajar memilih salak yang matang sempurna. Salak Pondoh Gabugan terkenal manis!\",\"description_en\":\"Pick salak pondoh directly from the tree in organic gardens. Accompanied by local farmers, learn to choose perfectly ripe salak.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/Pk9ogTXNAVLgaV633uafA44dmHwyWa4BEuPFkPjr.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1 hour\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu kebun, salak untuk dicicipi, tas buah\",\"includes_en\":\"Garden guide, salak tasting, fruit bag\",\"order\":5,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:57\"},{\"id\":6,\"title_id\":\"River Trekking\",\"title_en\":\"River Trekking\",\"slug\":\"river-trekking\",\"description_id\":\"Susuri aliran sungai jernih dari mata air Gunung Merapi. Air segar, pemandangan bebatuan vulkanik unik, dan ditemani pemandu lokal yang berpengalaman.\",\"description_en\":\"Explore the clear river flow from Mount Merapi springs. Fresh water, unique volcanic rock views, and experienced local guides.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/GhYj6kQXDxJfKNaUXQ8qt6u8EF71BjXnK3YNneTy.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu trekking, alas kaki khusus\",\"includes_en\":\"Trekking guide, special footwear\",\"order\":6,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:38\"},{\"id\":7,\"title_id\":\"Kuliner Ndeso\",\"title_en\":\"Village Cuisine\",\"slug\":\"kuliner-ndeso\",\"description_id\":\"Nikmati masakan tradisional khas pedesaan lereng Merapi. Mulai dari Sayur Lodeh Tewel, Sambal Belut Goreng, Nasi Liwet, hingga Wedang Jahe Merapi.\",\"description_en\":\"Enjoy traditional village cuisine on the slopes of Merapi. From Sayur Lodeh Tewel to Wedang Jahe Merapi.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/VqLmtF9NeGZJeJKMJePgi1xdMkOhS5UtI8RUqA53.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Paket menu lengkap, lesehan tradisional\",\"includes_en\":\"Complete menu package, traditional seating\",\"order\":7,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:33:09\"}],\"relevance_score\":5},\"blogs\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"title\",\"title_id\",\"title_en\",\"slug\",\"excerpt\",\"excerpt_id\",\"excerpt_en\",\"image\",\"meta_keywords_id\",\"meta_keywords_en\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"category_id\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"reads\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":7,\"title\":null,\"title_id\":\"Mengapa Wisata Edukasi di Desa Menjadi Pilihan Terbaik untuk Pelajar?\",\"title_en\":\"Why Educational Tourism in a Village Is the Best Choice for Students\",\"slug\":\"why-educational-tourism-in-a-village-is-the-best-choice-for-students\",\"excerpt\":null,\"excerpt_id\":\"Belajar tidak selalu harus dilakukan di dalam kelas. Saat ini, banyak sekolah mulai memilih wisata edukasi sebagai metode pembelajaran yang lebih menyenangkan d\",\"excerpt_en\":\"Learning doesn\'t always have to take place inside a classroom. Today, many schools choose educational tourism as a fun and meaningful learning method. One of th\",\"image\":\"blog\\/images\\/1ET2yBI4uFXnpdwIEoYC7zxbGdmIwrX0ivhdks0M.jpg\",\"meta_keywords_id\":null,\"meta_keywords_en\":null,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<p>Belajar tidak selalu harus dilakukan di dalam kelas. Saat ini, banyak sekolah mulai memilih wisata edukasi sebagai metode pembelajaran yang lebih menyenangkan dan bermakna. Salah satu destinasi yang menawarkan pengalaman tersebut adalah <strong>Desa Wisata Gabugan<\\/strong>, sebuah desa wisata edukasi di lereng Gunung Merapi, Kabupaten Sleman, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta.<\\/p><p>Mengusung konsep <strong>Rural Culture Experience<\\/strong>, Desa Wisata Gabugan mengajak peserta untuk belajar langsung dari kehidupan masyarakat desa. Melalui berbagai aktivitas interaktif, peserta tidak hanya memperoleh pengetahuan baru, tetapi juga membangun karakter seperti kerja sama, kepedulian, kemandirian, dan rasa syukur terhadap alam.<\\/p><p><strong>Belajar Langsung dari Alam<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Di Desa Wisata Gabugan, peserta dapat merasakan pengalaman yang sulit ditemukan di perkotaan. Mulai dari membajak sawah, menanam padi, menangkap ikan, hingga menjelajahi kebun Salak Gading. Aktivitas tersebut memberikan pemahaman mengenai proses produksi pangan sekaligus mengenalkan pentingnya menjaga lingkungan.<\\/p><p><strong>Mengenal Budaya Jawa<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Selain kegiatan pertanian, peserta juga diajak mengenal budaya lokal melalui kegiatan membatik, memainkan gamelan, belajar karawitan, permainan tradisional, hingga membuat kuliner khas desa. Seluruh kegiatan dikemas secara interaktif sehingga mudah dipahami oleh anak-anak maupun orang dewasa.<\\/p><p><strong>Cocok untuk Berbagai Kelompok<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Program wisata edukasi Desa Wisata Gabugan dapat diikuti oleh:<\\/p><ul><li>TK &amp; PAUD<\\/li><li>SD<\\/li><li>SMP<\\/li><li>SMA\\/SMK<\\/li><li>Mahasiswa<\\/li><li>Instansi Pemerintah<\\/li><li>Komunitas<\\/li><li>Keluarga<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Setiap program dapat disesuaikan dengan usia peserta dan tujuan pembelajaran.<\\/p><p><strong>Pengalaman yang Berkesan<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lebih dari sekadar berwisata, Desa Wisata Gabugan memberikan pengalaman belajar yang menyenangkan melalui interaksi langsung dengan masyarakat. Pengunjung dapat merasakan suasana pedesaan yang asri, udara yang sejuk, serta keramahan warga yang menjadi bagian dari pengalaman <strong>Rural Culture Experience<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>Apabila Anda sedang mencari destinasi wisata edukasi di Yogyakarta yang menggabungkan unsur alam, budaya, dan pembelajaran, Desa Wisata Gabugan adalah pilihan yang tepat.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<p>Learning doesn\'t always have to take place inside a classroom. Today, many schools choose educational tourism as a fun and meaningful learning method. One of the best destinations is <strong>Gabugan Tourism Village<\\/strong>, an educational tourism village located on the slopes of Mount Merapi in Sleman, Yogyakarta.<\\/p><p>Through its <strong>Rural Culture Experience<\\/strong> concept, Gabugan Tourism Village invites visitors to experience authentic village life. Participants not only gain new knowledge but also develop teamwork, independence, environmental awareness, and appreciation for local culture.<\\/p><p><strong>Learn Directly from Nature<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Visitors can experience activities rarely found in urban areas, including traditional rice field plowing, rice planting, fish catching, and exploring Salak Gading orchards. These hands-on experiences help participants understand agriculture while encouraging environmental awareness.<\\/p><p><strong>Discover Javanese Culture<\\/strong><\\/p><p>In addition to farming activities, visitors can learn batik making, play traditional gamelan music, experience Javanese performing arts, enjoy traditional games, and participate in local culinary workshops. Every activity is designed to be interactive and enjoyable for all ages.<\\/p><p><strong>Suitable for Various Groups<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Educational programs are available for:<\\/p><ul><li>Kindergarten<\\/li><li>Elementary Schools<\\/li><li>Junior High Schools<\\/li><li>Senior High Schools<\\/li><li>Universities<\\/li><li>Government Institutions<\\/li><li>Communities<\\/li><li>Families<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Programs can be customized according to participants\' needs and objectives.<\\/p><p><strong>A Memorable Learning Experience<\\/strong><\\/p><p>More than just a tourist destination, Gabugan Tourism Village offers meaningful learning through direct interaction with local communities. Visitors can enjoy the peaceful rural atmosphere, beautiful scenery, and warm hospitality that define the <strong>Rural Culture Experience<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>If you are looking for an educational tourism destination in Yogyakarta that combines nature, culture, and hands-on learning, Gabugan Tourism Village is the perfect choice.<\\/p>\",\"category_id\":7,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 14:54:22\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-19 01:07:05\",\"reads\":217}],\"relevance_score\":5}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Aktivitas ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 1\ntitle_id: Membajak Sawah Tradisional\ntitle_en: Traditional Rice Field Plowing\nslug: membajak-sawah-tradisional\ndescription_id: Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan kerbau yang jinak dan ramah. Dipandu oleh petani lokal berpengalaman, Anda akan belajar teknik membajak tradisional sambil ...\ndescription_en: Experience the sensation of being a traditional farmer by plowing rice fields using a tame and friendly buffalo. Guided by experienced local farmers.\nimage: activities/Cl3BIPPFLJroIAy14VozwjF7MlDI5kqtMZG7Six2.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu, alat membajak, air mineral\nincludes_en: Guide, plowing tools, mineral water\norder: 1\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:41\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:29:17\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 2\ntitle_id: Menanam Padi\ntitle_en: Rice Planting\nslug: menanam-padi\ndescription_id: Belajar cara menanam padi yang benar dari petani lokal. Mulai dari persiapan lahan, pemilihan bibit, hingga teknik menanam yang baik. Cocok untuk study tour sekolah dan keluarga.\ndescription_en: Learn how to plant rice properly from local farmers. Starting from land preparation, seed selection, to proper planting techniques.\nimage: activities/RhNJzErEcNZNWBDZmTGr908yhPZo3FDpwv014fbE.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu, bibit padi, air mineral\nincludes_en: Guide, rice seeds, mineral water\norder: 2\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:29:54\n\n--- #3 ---\nid: 3\ntitle_id: Belajar Gamelan & Karawitan\ntitle_en: Learning Gamelan & Karawitan\nslug: belajar-gamelan-karawitan\ndescription_id: Mainkan alat musik tradisional Jawa seperti saron, bonang, gong, dan kendang. Dipandu oleh seniman lokal, Anda akan belajar memainkan lagu-lagu tradisional.\ndescription_en: Play traditional Javanese musical instruments such as saron, bonang, gong, and kendang. Guided by local artists.\nimage: activities/xD66noKi23ctgXd0FiuZviKRZzElUvFpUmyh8GOZ.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Instrumen gamelan, pemandu seni, sertifikat\nincludes_en: Gamelan instruments, art guide, certificate\norder: 3\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:31:47\n\n--- #4 ---\nid: 4\ntitle_id: Belajar Membatik Tulis\ntitle_en: Learn Batik Making\nslug: belajar-membatik-tulis\ndescription_id: Belajar membatik tulis menggunakan canting langsung dari pengrajin berpengalaman. Hasil karya sendiri bisa dibawa pulang sebagai buah tangan berharga.\ndescription_en: Learn traditional batik making using canting directly from experienced artisans. Take home your own masterpiece.\nimage: activities/MNMBAWAjxXojOTr0dOJxOgcKkQOoRpQ3KRCSLVlq.jpg\nduration_id: 2-3 jam\nduration_en: 2-3 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Kain, canting, malam, pewarna, pemandu\nincludes_en: Fabric, canting, wax, dye, guide\norder: 4\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:07\n\n--- #5 ---\nid: 5\ntitle_id: Petik Salak Pondoh\ntitle_en: Salak Pondoh Harvesting\nslug: petik-salak-pondoh\ndescription_id: Petik salak pondoh langsung dari pohon di kebun organik. Ditemani petani lokal, belajar memilih salak yang matang sempurna. Salak Pondoh Gabugan terkenal manis!\ndescription_en: Pick salak pondoh directly from the tree in organic gardens. Accompanied by local farmers, learn to choose perfectly ripe salak.\nimage: activities/Pk9ogTXNAVLgaV633uafA44dmHwyWa4BEuPFkPjr.jpg\nduration_id: 1 jam\nduration_en: 1 hour\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu kebun, salak untuk dicicipi, tas buah\nincludes_en: Garden guide, salak tasting, fruit bag\norder: 5\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:57\n\n--- #6 ---\nid: 6\ntitle_id: River Trekking\ntitle_en: River Trekking\nslug: river-trekking\ndescription_id: Susuri aliran sungai jernih dari mata air Gunung Merapi. Air segar, pemandangan bebatuan vulkanik unik, dan ditemani pemandu lokal yang berpengalaman.\ndescription_en: Explore the clear river flow from Mount Merapi springs. Fresh water, unique volcanic rock views, and experienced local guides.\nimage: activities/GhYj6kQXDxJfKNaUXQ8qt6u8EF71BjXnK3YNneTy.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu trekking, alas kaki khusus\nincludes_en: Trekking guide, special footwear\norder: 6\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:38\n\n--- #7 ---\nid: 7\ntitle_id: Kuliner Ndeso\ntitle_en: Village Cuisine\nslug: kuliner-ndeso\ndescription_id: Nikmati masakan tradisional khas pedesaan lereng Merapi. Mulai dari Sayur Lodeh Tewel, Sambal Belut Goreng, Nasi Liwet, hingga Wedang Jahe Merapi.\ndescription_en: Enjoy traditional village cuisine on the slopes of Merapi. From Sayur Lodeh Tewel to Wedang Jahe Merapi.\nimage: activities/VqLmtF9NeGZJeJKMJePgi1xdMkOhS5UtI8RUqA53.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Paket menu lengkap, lesehan tradisional\nincludes_en: Complete menu package, traditional seating\norder: 7\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:33:09\n\n=== Artikel ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 7\ntitle_id: Mengapa Wisata Edukasi di Desa Menjadi Pilihan Terbaik untuk Pelajar?\ntitle_en: Why Educational Tourism in a Village Is the Best Choice for Students\nslug: why-educational-tourism-in-a-village-is-the-best-choice-for-students\nexcerpt_id: Belajar tidak selalu harus dilakukan di dalam kelas. Saat ini, banyak sekolah mulai memilih wisata edukasi sebagai metode pembelajaran yang lebih menyenangkan d\nexcerpt_en: Learning doesn\'t always have to take place inside a classroom. Today, many schools choose educational tourism as a fun and meaningful learning method. One of th\nimage: blog/images/1ET2yBI4uFXnpdwIEoYC7zxbGdmIwrX0ivhdks0M.jpg\ndescription_id: <p>Belajar tidak selalu harus dilakukan di dalam kelas. Saat ini, banyak sekolah mulai memilih wisata edukasi sebagai metode pembelajaran yang lebih menyenangkan dan bermakna. Salah satu destinasi yan...\ndescription_en: <p>Learning doesn\'t always have to take place inside a classroom. Today, many schools choose educational tourism as a fun and meaningful learning method. One of the best destinations is <strong>Gabuga...\ncategory_id: 7\ncreated_at: 2026-07-08 14:54:22\nupdated_at: 2026-07-19 01:07:05\nreads: 217\n\n', 'Halo Kak! 🙏 Berikut aktivitas seru yang bisa Kakak lakukan di <strong>Desa Wisata Gabugan</strong> 😊<br><br><a href=\"/activities/membajak-sawah-tradisional\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 p-2\"><img src=\"http://www.desawisatagabugan.com/storage/activities/Cl3BIPPFLJroIAy14VozwjF7MlDI5kqtMZG7Six2.jpg\" onerror=\"this.src=\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595855759920-86582396756a?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\'\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0\" alt=\"Membajak Sawah Tradisional\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#053d2c] leading-tight\">Membajak Sawah Tradisional</h4><p class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 line-clamp-2\">Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan ker...</p></div></div></a><a href=\"/activities/menanam-padi\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition mb-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 p-2\"><img src=\"http://www.desawisatagabugan.com/storage/activities/RhNJzErEcNZNWBDZmTGr908yhPZo3FDpwv014fbE.jpg\" onerror=\"this.src=\'https://i