​Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.<\\/p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan edukatif.<\\/p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.<\\/p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11 18:10:59\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:27:23\",\"is_signature\":0}],\"relevance_score\":50}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Paket Wisata ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 5\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: educational-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Edukasi\nlocation_en: Educational Village Homestay\nprice: 250000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, sert...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-08 16:21:28\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:30:28\nis_signature: 0\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 8\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: harmony-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Harmoni Desa\nlocation_en: Harmony Village Homestay\nprice: 215000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-11 18:10:59\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:27:23\nis_signature: 0\n\n', 'Selamat datang di Desa Wisata Gabugan, Kakak! 🌳🏠<br />\nSaya senang membantu merencanakan kunjungan rombongan siswa 110, guru 6, dan TL 8 untuk 4 hari 3 malam 📅.<br />\nKarena kami hanya memiliki paket wisata 1 Hari 1 Malam 🌟, saya akan membuatkan plan kunjungan custom untuk Kakak 📝.<br />\nBerikut adalah rencana kunjungan untuk 4 hari 3 malam:<br />\nHari 1: <br />\n- Pagi: Check-in di homestay 🏠<br />\n- Siang: Makan siang dan istirahat 🍴<br />\n- Sore: Mengikuti paket wisata \"Educational Village Homestay\" atau \"Harmony Village Homestay\" 🌈<br />\n- Malam: Makan malam dan acara bebas 🍴<br />\nHari 2: <br />\n- Pagi: Sarapan dan persiapan 🍞<br />\n- Siang: Mengikuti kegiatan di desa, seperti berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar dan menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan 🌾<br />\n- Sore: Istirahat dan acara bebas 🛋️<br />\n- Malam: Makan malam dan acara bebas 🍴<br />\nHari 3: <br />\n- Pagi: Sarapan dan persiapan 🍞<br />\n- Siang: Mengikuti kegiatan di desa, seperti berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar dan menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan 🌾<br />\n- Sore: Istirahat dan acara bebas 🛋️<br />\n- Malam: Makan malam dan acara bebas 🍴<br />\nHari 4: <br />\n- Pagi: Check-out dari homestay 🏠<br />\n- Siang: Makan siang dan kembali ke rumah 🍴<br />\nMonggo, Kakak bisa memilih paket wisata yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan dan budget rombongan 📊.<br />\nHarga paket wisata kami adalah:<br />\n- Educational Village Homestay: Rp 250.000 per orang 📚<br />\n- Harmony Village Homestay: Rp 215.000 per orang 🌈<br />\nApakah Kakak ingin saya membantu dengan reservasi atau memiliki pertanyaan lain? 🤔 Maturnuwun! 🙏', 2624, 'id', 1, NULL, '2026-07-21 09:36:45', '2026-07-21 09:36:45'),
(20, '91c2a85b-9545-4f04-9ce7-d25dac5a295c', '🌿 Info Paket Wisata', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/stro