nslug: harmony-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Harmoni Desa\nlocation_en: Harmony Village Homestay\nprice: 215000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-11 18:10:59\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:27:23\nis_signature: 0\n\n', 'Selamat datang di Desa Wisata Gabugan, Kakak! 🌳🏠<br />\nKami memiliki beberapa pilihan paket wisata yang menarik untuk Anda. Berikut adalah informasi tentang paket wisata kami:<br />\n1. <strong>Educational Village Homestay</strong> 🏫<br />\n   - Durasi: 1 Hari 1 Malam<br />\n   - Harga: Rp 250.000<br />\n   - Deskripsi: Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta mengalami kehidupan desa yang asri.<br />\n2. <strong>Harmony Village Homestay</strong> 🌈<br />\n   - Durasi: 1 Hari 1 Malam<br />\n   - Harga: Rp 215.000<br />\n   - Deskripsi: Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, serta merasakan harmoni kehidupan desa.<br />\nMonggo Kakak untuk memilih paket yang sesuai dengan minat dan kebutuhan Anda. Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan lebih lanjut atau ingin melakukan reservasi, jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami. Maturnuwun! 🙏<br />\nApakah ada yang bisa saya bantu lagi, Kakak? 🤗', 2161, 'id', 1, NULL, '2026-07-21 16:34:59', '2026-07-21 16:34:59'),
(21, '91c2a85b-9545-4f04-9ce7-d25dac5a295c', '💰 Harga & Biaya', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 16:21:28\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:30:28\",