(22, 'a64afb28-eeff-4902-a57c-f3855a8eb809', '🌿 Info Paket Wisata', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 16:21:28\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:30:28\",\"is_signature\":0},{\"id\":8,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"harmony-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Harmoni Desa\",\"location_en\":\"Harmony Village Homestay\",\"price\":215000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, dan menikmati kegiatan edukatif yang menggabungkan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk kunjungan sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Interaksi otentik dengan keluarga lokal<\\/p><p>• Aktivitas pendidikan langsung<\\/p><p>• Jadwal fleksibel untuk kelompok<\\/p><p>• Fasilitator lokal berpengalaman<\\/p><p>• Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• 2 Kali Makan<\\/p><p>• Menginap di rumah penduduk lokal<\\/p><p>• Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan<\\/p><p>• Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>• Pemandu Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>• Bus Antar-Jemput Gratis Bantuan<\\/p><p>• Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>• Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Batik<\\/p><p>• Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>• Musik Jawa Tradisional (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>• Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>• Pembuatan Suvenir<\\/p><p>• Trekking Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Tingkatkan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>• 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🎤 Musik Live \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🔊 Sistem Suara Besar — ​​Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.<\\/p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan edukatif.<\\/p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.<\\/p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11 18:10:59\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:27:23\",\"is_signature\":0}],\"relevance_score\":95}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Paket Wisata ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 5\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: educational-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Edukasi\nlocation_en: Educational Village Homestay\nprice: 250000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, sert...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-08 16:21:28\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:30:28\nis_signature: 0\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 8\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: harmony-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Harmoni Desa\nlocation_en: Harmony Village Homestay\nprice: 215000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-11 18:10:59\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:27:23\nis_signature: 0\n\n', 'Selamat datang di Desa Wisata Gabugan, Kakak! 🌿🏠 Kami memiliki beberapa pilihan paket wisata yang menarik untuk Anda. 🤩<br />\nKami menawarkan dua pilihan paket wisata dengan durasi 1 Hari 1 Malam. 📆 Pilihan pertama adalah paket \"Educational Village Homestay\" dengan harga Rp 250.000, 📚 yang memungkinkan Anda untuk berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar dan mendalami tradisi pedesaan. 🌾<br />\nPilihan kedua adalah paket \"Harmony Village Homestay\" dengan harga Rp 215.000, 🏠 yang juga menawarkan pengalaman desa yang mendalam dengan interaksi dengan penduduk setempat dan menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan. 🌻<br />\nMonggo, Kakak, pilih paket wisata yang sesuai dengan keinginan Anda! 🤗 Maturnuwun telah mempertimbangkan Desa Wisata Gabugan sebagai tujuan wisata Anda. 🙏<br />\nApakah Kakak memerlukan bantuan lebih lanjut untuk melakukan reservasi atau memilih paket wisata? 🤔', 12940, 'id', 1, NULL, '2026-07-22 14:08:17', '2026-07-22 14:08:17'),
(23, '711114ae-8bbf-4d92-8c21-bf7e590279be', '🎯 Fun Activities', '{\"activities\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"title_id\",\"title_en\",\"slug\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"image\",\"duration_id\",\"duration_en\",\"min_pax\",\"includes_id\",\"includes_en\",\"order\",\"is_featured\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":1,\"title_id\":\"Membajak Sawah Tradisional\",\"title_en\":\"Traditional Rice Field Plowing\",\"slug\":\"membajak-sawah-tradisional\",\"description_id\":\"Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan kerbau yang jinak dan ramah. Dipandu oleh petani lokal berpengalaman, Anda akan belajar teknik membajak tradisional sambil menikmati pemandangan sawah hijau yang asri.\",\"description_en\":\"Experience the sensation of being a traditional farmer by plowing rice fields using a tame and friendly buffalo. Guided by experienced local farmers.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/Cl3BIPPFLJroIAy14VozwjF7MlDI5kqtMZG7Six2.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu, alat membajak, air mineral\",\"includes_en\":\"Guide, plowing tools, mineral water\",\"order\":1,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:41\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:29:17\"},{\"id\":2,\"title_id\":\"Menanam Padi\",\"title_en\":\"Rice Planting\",\"slug\":\"menanam-padi\",\"description_id\":\"Belajar cara menanam padi yang benar dari petani lokal. Mulai dari persiapan lahan, pemilihan bibit, hingga teknik menanam yang baik. Cocok untuk study tour sekolah dan keluarga.\",\"description_en\":\"Learn how to plant rice properly from local farmers. Starting from land preparation, seed selection, to proper planting techniques.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/RhNJzErEcNZNWBDZmTGr908yhPZo3FDpwv014fbE.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu, bibit padi, air mineral\",\"includes_en\":\"Guide, rice seeds, mineral water\",\"order\":2,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:29:54\"},{\"id\":3,\"title_id\":\"Belajar Gamelan & Karawitan\",\"title_en\":\"Learning Gamelan & Karawitan\",\"slug\":\"belajar-gamelan-karawitan\",\"description_id\":\"Mainkan alat musik tradisional Jawa seperti saron, bonang, gong, dan kendang. Dipandu oleh seniman lokal, Anda akan belajar memainkan lagu-lagu tradisional.\",\"description_en\":\"Play traditional Javanese musical instruments such as saron, bonang, gong, and kendang. Guided by local artists.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/xD66noKi23ctgXd0FiuZviKRZzElUvFpUmyh8GOZ.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Instrumen gamelan, pemandu seni, sertifikat\",\"includes_en\":\"Gamelan instruments, art guide, certificate\",\"order\":3,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:31:47\"},{\"id\":4,\"title_id\":\"Belajar Membatik Tulis\",\"title_en\":\"Learn Batik Making\",\"slug\":\"belajar-membatik-tulis\",\"description_id\":\"Belajar membatik tulis menggunakan canting langsung dari pengrajin berpengalaman. Hasil karya sendiri bisa dibawa pulang sebagai buah tangan berharga.\",\"description_en\":\"Learn traditional batik making using canting directly from experienced artisans. Take home your own masterpiece.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/MNMBAWAjxXojOTr0dOJxOgcKkQOoRpQ3KRCSLVlq.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"2-3 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"2-3 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Kain, canting, malam, pewarna, pemandu\",\"includes_en\":\"Fabric, canting, wax, dye, guide\",\"order\":4,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:07\"},{\"id\":5,\"title_id\":\"Petik Salak Pondoh\",\"title_en\":\"Salak Pondoh Harvesting\",\"slug\":\"petik-salak-pondoh\",\"description_id\":\"Petik salak pondoh langsung dari pohon di kebun organik. Ditemani petani lokal, belajar memilih salak yang matang sempurna. Salak Pondoh Gabugan terkenal manis!\",\"description_en\":\"Pick salak pondoh directly from the tree in organic gardens. Accompanied by local farmers, learn to choose perfectly ripe salak.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/Pk9ogTXNAVLgaV633uafA44dmHwyWa4BEuPFkPjr.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1 hour\",\"min_pax\":\"1 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu kebun, salak untuk dicicipi, tas buah\",\"includes_en\":\"Garden guide, salak tasting, fruit bag\",\"order\":5,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:57\"},{\"id\":6,\"title_id\":\"River Trekking\",\"title_en\":\"River Trekking\",\"slug\":\"river-trekking\",\"description_id\":\"Susuri aliran sungai jernih dari mata air Gunung Merapi. Air segar, pemandangan bebatuan vulkanik unik, dan ditemani pemandu lokal yang berpengalaman.\",\"description_en\":\"Explore the clear river flow from Mount Merapi springs. Fresh water, unique volcanic rock views, and experienced local guides.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/GhYj6kQXDxJfKNaUXQ8qt6u8EF71BjXnK3YNneTy.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Pemandu trekking, alas kaki khusus\",\"includes_en\":\"Trekking guide, special footwear\",\"order\":6,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:32:38\"},{\"id\":7,\"title_id\":\"Kuliner Ndeso\",\"title_en\":\"Village Cuisine\",\"slug\":\"kuliner-ndeso\",\"description_id\":\"Nikmati masakan tradisional khas pedesaan lereng Merapi. Mulai dari Sayur Lodeh Tewel, Sambal Belut Goreng, Nasi Liwet, hingga Wedang Jahe Merapi.\",\"description_en\":\"Enjoy traditional village cuisine on the slopes of Merapi. From Sayur Lodeh Tewel to Wedang Jahe Merapi.\",\"image\":\"activities\\/VqLmtF9NeGZJeJKMJePgi1xdMkOhS5UtI8RUqA53.jpg\",\"duration_id\":\"1-2 jam\",\"duration_en\":\"1-2 hours\",\"min_pax\":\"2 orang\",\"includes_id\":\"Paket menu lengkap, lesehan tradisional\",\"includes_en\":\"Complete menu package, traditional seating\",\"order\":7,\"is_featured\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-09 17:14:42\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 08:33:09\"}],\"relevance_score\":23}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Aktivitas ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 1\ntitle_id: Membajak Sawah Tradisional\ntitle_en: Traditional Rice Field Plowing\nslug: membajak-sawah-tradisional\ndescription_id: Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan kerbau yang jinak dan ramah. Dipandu oleh petani lokal berpengalaman, Anda akan belajar teknik membajak tradisional sambil ...\ndescription_en: Experience the sensation of being a traditional farmer by plowing rice fields using a tame and friendly buffalo. Guided by experienced local farmers.\nimage: activities/Cl3BIPPFLJroIAy14VozwjF7MlDI5kqtMZG7Six2.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu, alat membajak, air mineral\nincludes_en: Guide, plowing tools, mineral water\norder: 1\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:41\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:29:17\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 2\ntitle_id: Menanam Padi\ntitle_en: Rice Planting\nslug: menanam-padi\ndescription_id: Belajar cara menanam padi yang benar dari petani lokal. Mulai dari persiapan lahan, pemilihan bibit, hingga teknik menanam yang baik. Cocok untuk study tour sekolah dan keluarga.\ndescription_en: Learn how to plant rice properly from local farmers. Starting from land preparation, seed selection, to proper planting techniques.\nimage: activities/RhNJzErEcNZNWBDZmTGr908yhPZo3FDpwv014fbE.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu, bibit padi, air mineral\nincludes_en: Guide, rice seeds, mineral water\norder: 2\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:29:54\n\n--- #3 ---\nid: 3\ntitle_id: Belajar Gamelan & Karawitan\ntitle_en: Learning Gamelan & Karawitan\nslug: belajar-gamelan-karawitan\ndescription_id: Mainkan alat musik tradisional Jawa seperti saron, bonang, gong, dan kendang. Dipandu oleh seniman lokal, Anda akan belajar memainkan lagu-lagu tradisional.\ndescription_en: Play traditional Javanese musical instruments such as saron, bonang, gong, and kendang. Guided by local artists.\nimage: activities/xD66noKi23ctgXd0FiuZviKRZzElUvFpUmyh8GOZ.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Instrumen gamelan, pemandu seni, sertifikat\nincludes_en: Gamelan instruments, art guide, certificate\norder: 3\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:31:47\n\n--- #4 ---\nid: 4\ntitle_id: Belajar Membatik Tulis\ntitle_en: Learn Batik Making\nslug: belajar-membatik-tulis\ndescription_id: Belajar membatik tulis menggunakan canting langsung dari pengrajin berpengalaman. Hasil karya sendiri bisa dibawa pulang sebagai buah tangan berharga.\ndescription_en: Learn traditional batik making using canting directly from experienced artisans. Take home your own masterpiece.\nimage: activities/MNMBAWAjxXojOTr0dOJxOgcKkQOoRpQ3KRCSLVlq.jpg\nduration_id: 2-3 jam\nduration_en: 2-3 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Kain, canting, malam, pewarna, pemandu\nincludes_en: Fabric, canting, wax, dye, guide\norder: 4\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:07\n\n--- #5 ---\nid: 5\ntitle_id: Petik Salak Pondoh\ntitle_en: Salak Pondoh Harvesting\nslug: petik-salak-pondoh\ndescription_id: Petik salak pondoh langsung dari pohon di kebun organik. Ditemani petani lokal, belajar memilih salak yang matang sempurna. Salak Pondoh Gabugan terkenal manis!\ndescription_en: Pick salak pondoh directly from the tree in organic gardens. Accompanied by local farmers, learn to choose perfectly ripe salak.\nimage: activities/Pk9ogTXNAVLgaV633uafA44dmHwyWa4BEuPFkPjr.jpg\nduration_id: 1 jam\nduration_en: 1 hour\nmin_pax: 1 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu kebun, salak untuk dicicipi, tas buah\nincludes_en: Garden guide, salak tasting, fruit bag\norder: 5\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:57\n\n--- #6 ---\nid: 6\ntitle_id: River Trekking\ntitle_en: River Trekking\nslug: river-trekking\ndescription_id: Susuri aliran sungai jernih dari mata air Gunung Merapi. Air segar, pemandangan bebatuan vulkanik unik, dan ditemani pemandu lokal yang berpengalaman.\ndescription_en: Explore the clear river flow from Mount Merapi springs. Fresh water, unique volcanic rock views, and experienced local guides.\nimage: activities/GhYj6kQXDxJfKNaUXQ8qt6u8EF71BjXnK3YNneTy.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Pemandu trekking, alas kaki khusus\nincludes_en: Trekking guide, special footwear\norder: 6\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:32:38\n\n--- #7 ---\nid: 7\ntitle_id: Kuliner Ndeso\ntitle_en: Village Cuisine\nslug: kuliner-ndeso\ndescription_id: Nikmati masakan tradisional khas pedesaan lereng Merapi. Mulai dari Sayur Lodeh Tewel, Sambal Belut Goreng, Nasi Liwet, hingga Wedang Jahe Merapi.\ndescription_en: Enjoy traditional village cuisine on the slopes of Merapi. From Sayur Lodeh Tewel to Wedang Jahe Merapi.\nimage: activities/VqLmtF9NeGZJeJKMJePgi1xdMkOhS5UtI8RUqA53.jpg\nduration_id: 1-2 jam\nduration_en: 1-2 hours\nmin_pax: 2 orang\nincludes_id: Paket menu lengkap, lesehan tradisional\nincludes_en: Complete menu package, traditional seating\norder: 7\nis_featured: 1\ncreated_at: 2026-07-09 17:14:42\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 08:33:09\n\n', '🎉 Selamat datang, Kakak! 🙏 Di Desa Wisata Gabugan, kita memiliki berbagai aktivitas menyenangkan yang bisa kamu nikmati 🤩. Berikut beberapa pilihan:<br />\n1. <strong>Membajak Sawah Tradisional</strong> 🌾: Rasakan sensasi menjadi petani tradisional dengan membajak sawah menggunakan kerbau yang jinak dan ramah 🐃.<br />\n2. <strong>Menanam Padi</strong> 🌱: Belajar cara menanam padi yang benar dari petani lokal, mulai dari persiapan lahan hingga teknik menanam yang baik 🌿.<br />\n3. <strong>Belajar Gamelan & Karawitan</strong> 🎶: Mainkan alat musik tradisional Jawa seperti saron, bonang, gong, dan kendang, dipandu oleh seniman lokal 🎵.<br />\n4. <strong>Belajar Membatik Tulis</strong> 🧵: Belajar membatik tulis menggunakan canting langsung dari pengrajin berpengalaman, dan hasil karya sendiri bisa dibawa pulang sebagai buah tangan berharga 🎁.<br />\n5. <strong>Petik Salak Pondoh</strong> 🍉: Petik salak pondoh langsung dari pohon di kebun organik, ditemani petani lokal, dan belajar memilih salak yang matang sempurna 🍊.<br />\n6. <strong>River Trekking</strong> 🏞️: Susuri aliran sungai jernih dari mata air Gunung Merapi, dengan pemandangan bebatuan vulkanik unik dan ditemani pemandu lokal yang berpengalaman 🏃‍♂️.<br />\n7. <strong>Kuliner Ndeso</strong> 🍴: Nikmati masakan tradisional khas pedesaan lereng Merapi, mulai dari Sayur Lodeh Tewel hingga Wedang Jahe Merapi 🍜.<br />\nMana aktivitas yang paling menarik bagi Kakak? 🤔 Monggo, silakan pilih dan kita akan membantu dengan reservasi dan informasi lebih lanjut 📅. Maturnuwun! 🙏', 3039, 'en', 1, NULL, '2026-07-23 17:26:16', '2026-07-23 17:26:16'),
(24, '711114ae-8bbf-4d92-8c21-bf7e590279be', '🌿 Tour Packages', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 16:21:28\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:30:28\",\"is_signature\":0},{\"id\":8,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"harmony-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Harmoni Desa\",\"location_en\":\"Harmony Village Homestay\",\"price\":215000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, dan menikmati kegiatan edukatif yang menggabungkan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk kunjungan sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Interaksi otentik dengan keluarga lokal<\\/p><p>• Aktivitas pendidikan langsung<\\/p><p>• Jadwal fleksibel untuk kelompok<\\/p><p>• Fasilitator lokal berpengalaman<\\/p><p>• Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• 2 Kali Makan<\\/p><p>• Menginap di rumah penduduk lokal<\\/p><p>• Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan<\\/p><p>• Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>• Pemandu Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>• Bus Antar-Jemput Gratis Bantuan<\\/p><p>• Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>• Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>• Lokakarya Batik<\\/p><p>• Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>• Musik Jawa Tradisional (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>• Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>• Pembuatan Suvenir<\\/p><p>• Trekking Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Tingkatkan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>• 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🎤 Musik Live \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>• 🔊 Sistem Suara Besar — ​​Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.<\\/p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan edukatif.<\\/p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.<\\/p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-11 18:10:59\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-11 20:27:23\",\"is_signature\":0}],\"relevance_score\":76}}', 'DATA DARI DATABASE DESA WISATA GABUGAN:\n\n=== Paket Wisata ===\n--- #1 ---\nid: 5\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: educational-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Edukasi\nlocation_en: Educational Village Homestay\nprice: 250000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, sert...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-08 16:21:28\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:30:28\nis_signature: 0\n\n--- #2 ---\nid: 8\ntype_id: 1 Hari 1 Malam\ntype_en: 1 Day 1 Night\nslug: harmony-village-homestay\nlocation_id: Live In Harmoni Desa\nlocation_en: Harmony Village Homestay\nprice: 215000\ndescription_id: <h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan...\ndescription_en: <h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditi...\ncreated_at: 2026-07-11 18:10:59\nupdated_at: 2026-07-11 20:27:23\nis_signature: 0\n\n', '🌟 Selamat datang, Kakak! 🙏 Kami memiliki beberapa pilihan paket wisata yang menarik di Desa Wisata Gabugan 🌿. Berikut adalah dua pilihan paket wisata yang bisa kamu pilih:<br />\n1. <strong>Paket Educational Village Homestay</strong> 🏠: Dengan harga Rp 250.000, kamu bisa menikmati pengalaman desa yang mendalam dan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar 🤝. Paket ini termasuk akomodasi di Educational Village Homestay dan kegiatan yang bisa membuat kamu lebih dekat dengan tradisi pedesaan 🌾.<br />\n2. <strong>Paket Harmony Village Homestay</strong> 🌈: Dengan harga Rp 215.000, kamu bisa menikmati pengalaman desa yang harmonis dan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat 🌟. Paket ini termasuk akomodasi di Harmony Village Homestay dan kegiatan yang bisa membuat kamu lebih mengenal tradisi pedesaan 🌿.<br />\nMana paket wisata yang paling menarik bagi Kakak? 🤔 Monggo, silakan pilih dan kita akan membantu dengan reservasi dan informasi lebih lanjut 📅. Maturnuwun! 🙏', 1866, 'en', 1, NULL, '2026-07-23 17:27:21', '2026-07-23 17:27:21');
INSERT INTO `chat_logs` (`id`, `session_id`, `user_message`, `found_data`, `prompt_sent`, `ai_response`, `response_time_ms`, `locale`, `success`, `error_message`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(25, '711114ae-8bbf-4d92-8c21-bf7e590279be', 'PAKET LIVE IN 2 HARI 1 MALAM', '{\"travel_packages\":{\"columns\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"type_id\",\"type_en\",\"slug\",\"location\",\"location_id\",\"location_en\",\"price\",\"description\",\"description_id\",\"description_en\",\"created_at\",\"updated_at\",\"is_signature\"],\"rows\":[{\"id\":5,\"type\":null,\"type_id\":\"1 Hari 1 Malam\",\"type_en\":\"1 Day 1 Night\",\"slug\":\"educational-village-homestay\",\"location\":null,\"location_id\":\"Live In Edukasi\",\"location_en\":\"Educational Village Homestay\",\"price\":250000,\"description\":null,\"description_id\":\"<h3><strong>Deskripsi<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan warga sekitar, mendalami tradisi pedesaan, serta menikmati kegiatan edukasi yang memadukan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk tamasya sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.<\\/p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Interaksi autentik dengan keluarga setempat<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kegiatan edukasi langsung<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rencana perjalanan fleksibel untuk grup<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fasilitator lokal yang berpengalaman<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cocok untuk semua kelompok umur<\\/p><h3><strong>Fasilitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3 kali makan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1 camilan<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Homestay dengan Keluarga Lokal<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan Apa Saja<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dukungan Audio Dasar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Panduan Aktivitas Profesional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Area Parkir Gratis<\\/p><h3><strong>Opsi Aktivitas<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pengalaman Pertanian<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perkebunan Salak<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Kuliner Tradisional<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Workshop Membatik<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Peternakan Burung Puyuh<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Musik Tradisional Jawa (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Perikanan Air Tawar<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Pembuatan Cinderamata<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Penjelajahan Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa<\\/p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Sempurnakan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan pendukung acara.<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<\\/p><p>· &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 🔊 Sound System Besar — Rp 700.000<\\/p><h3><strong>Catatan<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Harga didasarkan pada minimal 100 peserta.<br>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.<br>• Kegiatan bergantung pada cuaca dan kondisi musiman.<br>• Rencana perjalanan dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan grup Anda.<\\/p>\",\"description_en\":\"<h3><strong>Overview<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.<\\/p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups<\\/p><h3><strong>Facilities<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 Meals<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area<\\/p><h3><strong>Activity Options<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration<\\/p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music \\/ Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000<\\/p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000<\\/p><h3><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.<\\/p>\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-08 16:21:28\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-1