<strong>Optional Entertainment</strong></h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music / Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000</p><h3><strong>Notes</strong></h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.</p>', '2026-07-11 20:35:15', '2026-07-11 20:35:15', 0),
(10, NULL, '2 Hari 2 Malam', '2 Days 2 Nights', 'culture-nature-homestay', NULL, 'Live In Budaya & Alam', 'Culture & Nature Homestay', 325000, NULL, '<h3><strong>Gambaran Umum</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, dan menikmati kegiatan edukatif yang menggabungkan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk kunjungan sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.</p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?</strong></h3><p>• Interaksi otentik dengan keluarga lokal<br>• Aktivitas pendidikan langsung<br>• Jadwal fleksibel untuk kelompok<br>• Fasilitator lokal berpengalaman<br>• Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia</p><h3><strong>Fasilitas</strong></h3><p>• 4 Kali Makan<br>• 2 Camilan<br>• Menginap di rumah penduduk lokal<br>• Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan<br>• Dukungan Audio Dasar<br>• Pemandu Aktivitas Profesional<br>• Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<br>• Area Parkir Gratis</p><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas</strong></h3><p>• Pengalaman Pertanian<br>• Perkebunan Salak<br>• Lokakarya Kuliner Tradisional<br>• Lokakarya Batik<br>• Peternakan Puyuh<br>• Musik Jawa Tradisional (Gamelan)<br>• Perikanan Air Tawar<br>• Pembuatan Suvenir<br>• Trekking Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa</p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional</strong></h3><p>Tingkatkan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan dukungan acara.</p><p>• 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<br>• 🎤 Musik Live / Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<br>• 🔊 Sistem Suara Besar — ​​Rp 700.000</p><h3><strong>Catatan</strong></h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.</p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.</p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.</p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.</p>', '<h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups</p><h3><strong>Facilities</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 Meals</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 Snacks</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Homestay with Local Families</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area</p><h3><strong>Activity Options</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration</p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment</strong></h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music / Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000</p><h3><strong>Notes</strong></h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.</p>', '2026-07-11 20:40:23', '2026-07-11 20:40:23', 0),
(11, NULL, '1 Hari', '1 Day', 'village-discovery', NULL, 'Village Discovery', 'Village Discovery', 160000, NULL, '<h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui pengalaman desa yang mendalam. Peserta akan berinteraksi dengan penduduk setempat, menjelajahi tradisi pedesaan, dan menikmati kegiatan edukatif yang menggabungkan budaya, pertanian, warisan kuliner, dan alam. Program ini ideal untuk kunjungan sekolah, universitas, lembaga pemerintah, perusahaan, dan kelompok masyarakat.</p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Ini?</strong></h3><p>• Interaksi otentik dengan keluarga lokal<br>• Aktivitas pendidikan langsung<br>• Jadwal fleksibel untuk kelompok<br>• Fasilitator lokal berpengalaman<br>• Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia</p><h3><strong>Fasilitas</strong></h3><p>• 1 Makan<br>• 1 Snack<br>• Program Perjalanan Sehari (Tanpa Menginap)<br>• Pilih 5 Aktivitas Pendidikan<br>• Dukungan Audio Dasar<br>• Pemandu Aktivitas Profesional<br>• Bantuan Bus Kru Gratis<br>• Area Parkir Gratis</p><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas</strong></h3><p>• Pengalaman Pertanian<br>• Perkebunan Salak<br>• Lokakarya Kuliner Tradisional<br>• Lokakarya Batik<br>• Peternakan Puyuh<br>• Musik Jawa Tradisional (Gamelan)<br>• Perikanan Air Tawar<br>• Pembuatan Suvenir<br>• Trekking Sungai &amp; Eksplorasi Desa</p><h3><strong>Hiburan Opsional</strong></h3><p>Tingkatkan kunjungan Anda dengan hiburan tambahan dan layanan dukungan acara.</p><p>• 🎭 Pertunjukan Budaya Tradisional — Rp 1.500.000<br>• 🎤 Musik Live / Organ Tunggal — Rp 1.500.000<br>• 🔊 Sistem Suara Besar — ​​Rp 700.000</p><h3><strong>Catatan</strong></h3><p>• Harga berdasarkan minimal 100 peserta.</p><p>• Setiap kelompok dapat memilih hingga lima kegiatan pendidikan.</p><p>• Kegiatan bergantung pada kondisi cuaca dan musim.</p><p>• Jadwal dapat disesuaikan sesuai kebutuhan kelompok Anda.</p>', '<h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through an immersive village experience. Participants will interact with local residents, explore rural traditions, and enjoy educational activities that combine culture, agriculture, culinary heritage, and nature. The program is ideal for school excursions, universities, government institutions, companies, and community groups.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose This Package?</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Authentic interaction with local families</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hands-on educational activities</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Flexible itinerary for groups</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Experienced local facilitators</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Suitable for all age groups</p><h3><strong>Facilities</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Meal</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 Snack</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Day Trip Program (No Overnight Stay)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Choose Any 5 Educational Activities</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Basic Audio Support</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Professional Activity Guide</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Crew Bus Assistance</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Free Parking Area</p><h3><strong>Activity Options</strong></h3><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Agriculture Experience</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Salak Plantation</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Culinary Workshop</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Batik Workshop</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Quail Farming</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Freshwater Fishery</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Souvenir Making</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration</p><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment</strong></h3><p>Enhance your visit with additional entertainment and event support services.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎭 Traditional Cultural Performance — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎤 Live Music / Organ Tunggal — IDR 1,500,000</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🔊 Large Sound System — IDR 700,000</p><h3><strong>Notes</strong></h3><p>• Prices are based on a minimum of 100 participants.<br>• Each group may choose up to five educational activities.<br>• Activities are subject to weather and seasonal conditions.<br>• The itinerary can be customized according to your group\'s needs.</p>', '2026-07-11 20:45:51', '2026-07-11 20:45:51', 0),
(12, NULL, 'Paket Custom', 'Custom Package', 'design-your-own-village-experience', NULL, 'Rancang Pengalaman Wisata Sesuai Kebutuhan Anda', 'Design Your Own Village Experience', 999999999, NULL, '<h3><strong>Deskripsi</strong></h3><p>Setiap rombongan memiliki tujuan dan kebutuhan yang berbeda. Oleh karena itu, Desa Wisata Gabugan menghadirkan <strong>Paket Custom</strong>, sebuah program wisata edukasi yang dapat dirancang secara fleksibel sesuai dengan jumlah peserta, durasi kegiatan, anggaran, serta aktivitas yang diinginkan.</p><p>Mulai dari kunjungan singkat selama beberapa jam hingga program Live In selama beberapa hari, seluruh rangkaian kegiatan dapat disesuaikan bersama tim kami. Anda bebas memilih kombinasi aktivitas edukatif, budaya, kuliner, maupun petualangan sehingga pengalaman yang diperoleh benar-benar sesuai dengan tujuan kunjungan.</p><p>Baik untuk sekolah, perguruan tinggi, instansi pemerintah, perusahaan, komunitas, maupun keluarga besar, kami siap membantu menyusun program yang berkesan, aman, dan menyenangkan.</p><h3><strong>Mengapa Memilih Paket Custom?</strong></h3><ul><li>Program dirancang sesuai kebutuhan rombongan</li><li>Durasi kegiatan yang fleksibel</li><li>Bebas memilih aktivitas edukatif</li><li>Menyesuaikan anggaran yang tersedia</li><li>Cocok untuk berbagai usia dan jenis kegiatan</li><li>Didampingi fasilitator berpengalaman</li><li>Konsultasi gratis sebelum reservasi</li></ul><h3><strong>Anda Dapat Menyesuaikan</strong></h3><h3><strong>Durasi Kegiatan</strong></h3><ul><li>Half Day Program</li><li>One Day Trip</li><li>2 Hari 1 Malam</li><li>2 Hari 2 Malam</li><li>3 Hari 2 Malam</li><li>Durasi lainnya sesuai kebutuhan</li></ul><h3><strong>Pilihan Aktivitas</strong></h3><p>Pilih hingga <strong>5 aktivitas</strong> atau lebih sesuai kebutuhan.</p><ul><li>🌾 Edukasi Pertanian</li><li>🌴 Edukasi Perkebunan Salak</li><li>🍽️ Edukasi Kuliner Tradisional</li><li>🎨 Edukasi Membatik</li><li>🎼 Edukasi Karawitan</li><li>🐦 Edukasi Peternakan Burung Puyuh</li><li>🎣 Edukasi Perikanan</li><li>🛍️ Membuat Cinderamata</li><li>🥾 Tracking Sungai &amp; Lintas Desa</li></ul><h3><strong>Fasilitas</strong></h3><p>Fasilitas akan disesuaikan dengan paket yang dipilih, antara lain:</p><ul><li>Konsultasi Program</li><li>Penyusunan Itinerary</li><li>Pemandu Kegiatan</li><li>Perlengkapan Audio Dasar (Basic Audio Support)</li><li>Area Parkir</li><li>Free Crew Bus</li><li>Makan dan Snack (sesuai paket)</li><li>Live In di Rumah Warga (opsional)</li></ul><h3><strong>Hiburan Tambahan (Opsional)</strong></h3><p>Lengkapi pengalaman rombongan Anda dengan berbagai pilihan hiburan dan pendukung acara.</p><p>🎭 <strong>Traditional Cultural Performance</strong> — <strong>Rp1.500.000</strong></p><p>🎤 <strong>Live Music / Organ Tunggal</strong> — <strong>Rp1.500.000</strong></p><p>🔊 <strong>Sound System Besar</strong> — <strong>Rp700.000</strong></p><h3><strong>Cocok Untuk</strong></h3><ul><li>Study Tour</li><li>Outing Class</li><li>Company Gathering</li><li>Family Gathering</li><li>Kunjungan Instansi</li><li>Program Mahasiswa</li><li>Community Gathering</li><li>Leadership Camp</li><li>Educational Trip</li><li>Wisata Keluarga</li></ul><h3><strong>Catatan</strong></h3><ul><li>Harga akan disesuaikan dengan jumlah peserta, durasi kegiatan, pilihan aktivitas, serta fasilitas yang dipilih.</li><li>Tim Desa Wisata Gabugan akan membantu menyusun program terbaik sesuai kebutuhan rombongan.</li><li><p>Konsultasi dan penyusunan proposal kegiatan tidak dikenakan biaya.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><blockquote><p><strong>\"Pengalaman Anda, Sesuai Keinginan Anda.\"</strong><br>Ciptakan petualangan desa yang dipersonalisasi dan temukan pesona otentik Desa Wisata Gabugan melalui program yang dirancang khusus untuk Anda.</p></blockquote>', '<h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3><p>Every group has different goals, interests, and budgets. That\'s why Desa Wisata Gabugan offers a <strong>Custom Package</strong>, allowing you to create a personalized educational village experience tailored to your specific needs.</p><p>Whether you are planning a short educational visit, a full-day excursion, or a multi-day village immersion program, our team will work closely with you to design the perfect itinerary. Choose your preferred activities, duration, facilities, and learning objectives to create a memorable experience for your participants.</p><p>This package is ideal for schools, universities, government institutions, corporate groups, communities, and family gatherings looking for a unique and flexible rural tourism experience.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose a Custom Package?</strong></h3><ul><li>Fully personalized itinerary</li><li>Flexible duration and schedule</li><li>Choose your preferred educational activities</li><li>Designed to match your budget</li><li>Suitable for all age groups</li><li>Experienced local facilitators</li><li>Free consultation before booking</li></ul><h3><strong>Customize Your Experience</strong></h3><h3><strong>Duration Options</strong></h3><ul><li>Half-Day Program</li><li>One-Day Trip</li><li>2 Days 1 Night</li><li>2 Days 2 Nights</li><li>3 Days 2 Nights</li><li>Or any duration that suits your needs</li></ul><h3><strong>Activity Options</strong></h3><p>Choose up to <strong>five educational activities</strong> or more depending on your program.</p><ul><li>🌾 Agriculture Experience</li><li>🌴 Salak Plantation Experience</li><li>🍽️ Traditional Culinary Workshop</li><li>🎨 Batik Workshop</li><li>🎼 Traditional Javanese Music (Gamelan)</li><li>🐦 Quail Farming</li><li>🎣 Freshwater Fishery</li><li>🛍️ Souvenir Making</li><li>🥾 River Trekking &amp; Village Exploration</li></ul><h3><strong>Facilities</strong></h3><p>Facilities can be customized according to your selected program and may include:</p><ul><li>Program Consultation</li><li>Customized Itinerary Planning</li><li>Professional Activity Guide</li><li>Basic Audio Support</li><li>Parking Area</li><li>Free Crew Bus Assistance</li><li>Meals and Snacks</li><li>Homestay with Local Families (Optional)</li></ul><h3><strong>Optional Entertainment</strong></h3><p>🎭 <strong>Traditional Cultural Performance</strong> — <strong>IDR 1,500,000</strong></p><p>🎤 <strong>Live Music / Organ Tunggal</strong> — <strong>IDR 1,500,000</strong></p><p>🔊 <strong>Large Sound System</strong> — <strong>IDR 700,000</strong></p><h3><strong>Perfect For</strong></h3><ul><li>School Study Tours</li><li>Educational Visits</li><li>Universities</li><li>Corporate Gatherings</li><li>Government Institutions</li><li>Community Organizations</li><li>Family Gatherings</li><li>Leadership Programs</li><li>Cultural Exchange Programs</li></ul><h3><strong>Notes</strong></h3><ul><li>Pricing will be customized based on the number of participants, duration, selected activities, and requested facilities.</li><li>Our team will help design the most suitable program for your group.</li><li><p>Consultation and itinerary planning are provided free of charge.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><blockquote><p><strong>\"Your Experience, Your Way.\"</strong><br>Create a personalized village adventure and discover the authentic charm of Desa Wisata Gabugan through a program designed just for you.</p></blockquote>', '2026-07-11 20:58:43', '2026-07-11 20:58:43', 0);
